{"questionUid":"qid_v1_f2d73f1a7f05cf6ac999f48101d8022d1c4ca345492e582fd9eaf78f8fda66fc","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/1mid/23_동산중_1학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":18,"sourceFingerprint":"c6909778d99f79f119771ad730c8d50990e41df72a20f5a0463da4ff4096ce0c","inputBundleSha":"3ef4c85732fe9dfe6be5ea708e333097d97066f524fe1837f31894fd32991ef8","contentHash":"f0bc0c276d4ef8d48a0333395323ad6f07ddce8e00a4e5269bb61dcefd046183","solutionHash":"7b4c87d850e792a072ee1ea57a9d7104e3b0d00874ddda281f501db5b6cd2106","content":"어느 옷 가게에서는 정가가 $a$원인 티셔츠를 $20\\%$ 할인하여 판매한다. 이 가게에서 티셔츠 한 장을 사고 5만 원을 냈을 때의 거스름돈을 문자를 사용한 식으로 나타내면?","choices":["$(50000-20a)$원","$(0.8a+50000)$원","$(0.8a-50000)$원","$(50000-0.2a)$원","$(50000-0.8a)$원"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"직선각과 맞꼭지각, 평행선의 동위각·엇각 및 삼각형의 내각의 합을 이용해 그림의 각을 차례로 계산한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ⑤이다.","images":[],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-03","subUnitKey":"M1-03-ALGEBRAIC_EXPRESSION","primaryMethod":"Represent sale price as 80% of a, then subtract that price from 50,000.","decisiveStep":"Change=50,000−0.8a, choice ⑤.","problemTypeKey":"PT_ALGEBRAIC_QUANTITY_TRANSLATION_CHECK","templateKey":"TPL_CHANGE_AFTER_PERCENT_DISCOUNT_PURCHASE","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"SEQUENTIAL","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Archived solution gives unrelated angle geometry. The source currency model supports ⑤."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"8f32e4627608d3903eca00b52684ae96d7313fe178650532e1815c7f04f86cd8"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_30c291c6598021a7dd7fd9bb63dfeefd5c794ff5906efe79314df3e06319d3b6","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/1mid/23_동산중_1학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":19,"sourceFingerprint":"95a69266218d36b22c5d449cf8758e859af9c195706fc43c5b0fe2d23045be8d","inputBundleSha":"5dd6b7da7996228fe11232b2da2d868cb527b48a641b27af82808612b5ab38de","contentHash":"b438004a6f7ae48a70b49604d0cf3ee8cb1782d4a854cd3772f1c2e3bb75d49f","solutionHash":"b3222dc6274acce51321cfc048d9e791525bf9a504955426fe0ee8c56fbf7f00","content":"다음 중 기호 $\\times$, $\\div$를 생략하여 나타낸 식으로 옳지 않은 것은?","choices":["$x\\div y-1=\\dfrac{x}{y}-1$","$x\\div y\\times 7\\times x=\\dfrac{7x^2}{y}$","$0.1\\times a\\times(-a)=-0.1a^2$","$a\\times b\\div(-2)\\times b=-2ab^2$","$(-2)\\times x-3\\div y=-2x-\\dfrac{3}{y}$"],"answer":"④","solution":"주어진 식을 정리하고 필요한 값을 대입한 뒤 등식 또는 부등식의 기본 성질에 따라 계산한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ④이다.","images":[],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-03","subUnitKey":"M1-03-ALGEBRAIC_EXPRESSION","primaryMethod":"Restore the implicit multiplication/division in each option and compare equivalent forms.","decisiveStep":"ab÷(−2)×b=−ab²/2, not −2ab²; choice ④ is incorrect.","problemTypeKey":"PT_ALGEBRAIC_OPERATION_NOTATION_VALIDITY","templateKey":"TPL_FIND_FALSE_SUPPRESSED_MULTIPLICATION_DIVISION_FORM","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"NONE","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Archived solution is generic and does not restore the omitted operations. The source shows option ④ is false."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"2df93761954cfcf49f518bedd62079269dde5cf781744e3c3198a79776914777"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_573a827f1d9204561710ae964c0fc75af34d1d870a437d5f2bee29531eabf8b4","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/1mid/23_동산중_1학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":20,"sourceFingerprint":"3c7f9ba5610b4e4164f605cb4252ac575cea7fd553e1561adf26b1f9874d543b","inputBundleSha":"ce551681574f288b7ea8254817d7679b3d69ea1c9b7bca328867ca33d13500a9","contentHash":"1814ba21a28201eecc560bc211faea1b7ef95907a29a2c4eca4ab600088b48e7","solutionHash":"b3222dc6274acce51321cfc048d9e791525bf9a504955426fe0ee8c56fbf7f00","content":"$a=\\dfrac{1}{3}$일 때, 다음 중 식의 값이 $-2$인 것은?","choices":["$\\dfrac{2}{a}$","$2-a$","$3a-1$","$3(a-1)$","$6a-a^2$"],"answer":"④","solution":"주어진 식을 정리하고 필요한 값을 대입한 뒤 등식 또는 부등식의 기본 성질에 따라 계산한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ④이다.","images":[],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-03","subUnitKey":"M1-03-ALGEBRAIC_EXPRESSION","primaryMethod":"Substitute a=1/3 into every option and evaluate.","decisiveStep":"3(a−1)=3(−2/3)=−2, so choice ④.","problemTypeKey":"PT_ALGEBRAIC_EXPRESSION_VALUE_SUBSTITUTION","templateKey":"TPL_SELECT_EXPRESSION_MATCHING_TARGET_VALUE","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"NONE","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Archived solution is generic and does not evaluate the options. The source gives ④ as the only expression with value −2."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"f687f2e108821fe81c1b3a1bc611d94a328511e8b4514bbe3c6d80b1e9f38315"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_a1a75735b2684fb4a04060caf8402f197a419419d376cffc70aa293b8e15a0b6","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/1mid/23_동산중_1학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":21,"sourceFingerprint":"349d4e4e8b6d16aca5eb695ad294066a2ed4782bce67453e14e9088a84ad57fb","inputBundleSha":"37a3e1bd631b89441f19dc6659897a149ac82889128a018838be0ebf9f403ec4","contentHash":"05535a49b7e42d2787ab886815630775582059850b567fa5640464d59a0c2398","solutionHash":"4ea351fb67bdc1102c8d3f760fef41f9c58a97beee4603e641dda559ea7f29c1","content":"서술형1. 세 자연수 $20$, $50$, $A$의 최대공약수는 $10$이고 최소공배수는 $200$일 때, $A$가 될 수 있는 수를 모두 구하시오. (단, 풀이 과정을 자세히 쓰시오.)","choices":[],"answer":"40, 200","solution":"풀이: 주어진 식을 정리하고 필요한 값을 대입한 뒤 등식 또는 부등식의 기본 성질에 따라 계산한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 40, 200이다.","images":[],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-01","subUnitKey":"M1-01-GCD_LCM","primaryMethod":"Use gcd(20,50)=10 and lcm(20,50)=100, then impose gcd(10,A)=10 and lcm(100,A)=200.","decisiveStep":"The lcm condition requires A to contain 2³ and no primes beyond 2 and 5; the gcd requires a factor 5, so A=40 or 200.","problemTypeKey":"PT_GCD_LCM_PARAMETER_RECOVERY","templateKey":"TPL_ENUMERATE_ALL_VALUES_FROM_GCD_LCM_EXPONENTS","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":["COND_NATURAL_NUMBER"],"integrationPattern":"INTERDEPENDENT","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Archived solution is generic and does not enumerate prime exponents. The source constraints yield exactly 40 and 200."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"f06d6b200e22df71dffb77e37653e3bf17a064394218bf09f44aae70fba6f47b"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_8bebcc6498ee3c67f0f667c0026994659471a518190591839829c1e495f3507a","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/1mid/23_동산중_1학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":22,"sourceFingerprint":"1f2d6359c03e1e56330ba00c267a5928c365557fec9de8c8534df53ac49926e1","inputBundleSha":"8198bfd4ee9e719a2d406b3489adc7e71930e906fc2988b7b7c6c961e68153c0","contentHash":"287c116eea3a4c9d538107ee9a476f279c84726f942244ed09dbc8f35f28fc00","solutionHash":"030b9819f2fa9fce291e84c5882c1cb72a5b17aadf3cf43cff9fe8bb83e2b352","content":"서술형2. 세 유리수 $a$, $b$, $c$에 대하여 $a\\times b<0$, $a-b>0$, $b\\div c>0$이 성립할 때, $a\\times b\\times c$의 부호를 구하시오. (단, 풀이 과정을 자세히 쓰시오.)","choices":[],"answer":"양수","solution":"풀이: 문항의 정의와 제시된 조건을 순서대로 적용하여 보기 또는 계산 결과를 확인한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 양수이다.","images":[],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-02","subUnitKey":"M1-02-INTEGER_RATIONAL_NUMBER","primaryMethod":"Use ab<0 and a−b>0 to infer a>0,b<0, then b/c>0 to infer c<0.","decisiveStep":"The signs are (+)(−)(−), so abc is positive.","problemTypeKey":"PT_SIGN_CONSTRAINT_DEDUCTION_FOR_RATIONALS","templateKey":"TPL_PRODUCT_DIFFERENCE_QUOTIENT_SIGN_CHAIN","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"SEQUENTIAL","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"Archived solution is generic and omits sign inference. Source conditions imply a positive product."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"36e6d32594f2837499e12daf61253619efa613fad710a5a5da64db6275084732"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_ddc3c56a31615a03f25e6bf6f60ef41d8ef83386265a8a1d9433593d5448cca3","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/1mid/23_동산중_1학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":23,"sourceFingerprint":"8e0565e4e94e637164d02963f8a20abe9eeb84253480550ebf678c1d951d0673","inputBundleSha":"ec7fafe4d2121c6edd5f95eb29be659763f1b1598f97cbc5387f29d8c65af17e","contentHash":"e1ff4efaed2e475b4907a1faf3c7e276ae60aaf8b2146a6c0ce8bb28bed57c04","solutionHash":"0484b081bbb3e4e19f01fc85c8854155906dcd07c7062a9ca8ad2dd70c3b241e","content":"서술형3. 다음 식의 계산 순서를 차례로 나열하고 계산하시오. (단, 풀이 과정을 자세히 쓰시오.)","choices":[],"answer":"ㄹ → ㄷ → ㄴ → ㅁ → ㄱ, -4","solution":"풀이: 주어진 식을 정리하고 필요한 값을 대입한 뒤 등식 또는 부등식의 기본 성질에 따라 계산한다. 그림의 대응 위치와 조건을 함께 확인하면 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ㄹ → ㄷ → ㄴ → ㅁ → ㄱ, -4이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_동산중_1학기_중간_중1_기출/q23.png","exists":true,"sha256":"62bd9c938446cd87e5958b91106e3578df7ee8b360a017c880af71e7f7fe2b2b"}],"semanticContext":{"standardUnitKey":"M1-02","subUnitKey":"M1-02-RATIONAL_NUMBER_OPERATIONS","primaryMethod":"도식의 다섯 표식을 연산자에 대응한 뒤 괄호와 거듭제곱을 먼저 계산하고, 나눗셈·안쪽 뺄셈·곱셈·바깥 뺄셈 순으로 진행한다.","decisiveStep":"Image labels left-to-right are ㄱ (outer 3−), ㄴ (inner 2−), ㄷ (4÷), ㄹ (the power), ㅁ (×(-1)). The correct order is ㄹ→ㄷ→ㄴ→ㅁ→ㄱ: (-2/3)^2=4/9; 4÷4/9=9; 2−9=−7; (−7)×(−1)=7; 3−7=−4.","problemTypeKey":"PT_ORDER_OF_OPERATIONS_NUMERICAL_EXPRESSION","templateKey":"TPL_NESTED_FRACTION_POWER_AND_SIGNED_MULTIPLICATION","crossConceptKeys":[],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"NONE","reviewStatus":"PROPOSED","sourceIssue":"보관 풀이는 구체적인 중간 산술을 제시하지 않지만 그림의 연산자 표식과 정답 순서·값 사이에 모순은 없다."},"inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceFingerprint","inputBundleSha","contentHash","solutionHash","content","choices","answer","solution","images","semanticContext"],"blindInputSha":"efdacb881fd879be90488601ffd2733c415b8b18ef2e6456975ae5516bdeea44"}
